  Slug: abyssal-merfolk
  DisplayName: Abyssal Merfolk
  IconPath: icons/magic/water/water-elemental-blue-teeth.webp
  Description: You live far, far below the surface of the ocean. Your fish tail might
    resemble a viperfish or anglerfish, and you might have luminous eyes or translucent
    skin. Abyssal merfolk have an uncanny reputation, but they can exist in even
    the most lightless realms. You gain darkvision and are immune to the crushing
    pressure of the oceanic depths.
